
Package: finalproject
Title: Public Health Analysis of BMI and Homicide Mortality
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Tongtong",
           family = "Gu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tongtonggu@hsph.harvard.edu")
Description: This project investigates age-related BMI patterns
    among U.S. adults using NHANES data and geographic and
    temporal patterns of homicide mortality using CDC data.
    The project uses descriptive statistics, visualization,
    and statistical modeling to study public health questions.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
